r-projects.md","line":28},{"title":"contributing indicators","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/performance-analytics-glossary.md","line":34},{"title":"Manual indicators","target":"t_CreateAManualIndicator","line":106},{"title":"Design your Performance Analytics solution with KPI Composer","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/designing-pa-solution.md","line":133},{"title":"Automated indicators","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/automated-indicators.md","line":138},{"title":"Indicator sources","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/c_IndicatorSources.md","line":140},{"title":"Formula indicators","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/formula-indicators.md","line":142},{"title":"Manual indicators","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/t_CreateAManualIndicator.md","line":144},{"title":"Create an indicator definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/create-indicator-definition.md","line":166},{"title":"contributing indicator","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/performance-analytics-glossary.md","line":173},{"title":"Performance Analytics indicators","target":"c_Indicators","line":183},{"title":"Manual indicators","target":"t_CreateAManualIndicator","line":184}],"metadata":{"title":"Create an indicator definition","description":"You can create a new 